245	\midrule
246	MiniLM & --- & $+$0.208 & $0.011$ & --- & --- \\
247	MiniLM & log freq & --- & --- & $+$0.133 & $0.11$ \\
248	MiniLM & log freq $+$ degree & --- & --- & --- & $0.23$ \\
