250	Qwen3 & --- & $+$0.184 & $0.025$ & --- & --- \\
251	Qwen3 & degree centrality & --- & --- & $+$0.063 & $0.44$ \\
252	Qwen3 & log freq $+$ degree & --- & --- & --- & $0.44$ \\
